2. CREDENTIALS AND BRING-YOUR-OWN-KEY

The Software does not require an account with us. To use AI features, you supply
your own credentials and API keys for the third-party model and service
providers you choose (for example, Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, Ollama, LM Studio,
fal.ai, Replicate, or Tencent). You are responsible for obtaining those
credentials, complying with the applicable provider's terms, and keeping your
credentials secure.

Credentials and keys you configure are stored locally on your device and are
used to communicate directly with the providers you select. You are responsible
for all activity that occurs under your credentials and for any charges those
providers bill to you.

